# Architecture (docs/guide/how-architecture.md). Rendered to how-architecture.svg by go generate.
title: The host's agent reasons from a skill, and the aayu binary does every check and every write
direction: down
agent: Host and its agent: Amp, Cursor, or Claude Code
skill: Skill: SKILL.md copied into the repository
mcp: aayu mcp: verbs as MCP tools over stdio
binary: aayu binary: checks, writes, hooks
github: GitHub: issues, pull requests, checks
ci: CI workflows: merge gate, triage, loops
ledger: ledger branch: packs, snapshots, actions log
agent -> skill: reads
agent -> mcp: tool calls
skill -> binary: runs aayu verbs
mcp -> binary: runs verbs in-process
binary -> github: writes through actions
github -> ci: events start runs
ci -> ledger: authoritative pack
